{
  "version": "1.0",
  "rules": {
    "base-route": "normal standard spring with opacity150 and at most8dp vertical travel; gesture driven routes follow OS; reduced opacity150. Never block inputs. Tab underline uses standard with measured center-to-center offset, selectionClick once per user selection; at200% follow actual 2x2 bounds, no diagonal screen fly.",
    "form-focus-error": "focus border crossfade150; new validation error on attempted submit: x=[0,2,-2,2,-2,0] at[0,40,80,120,160,200]ms, one mediumImpact at0. No shake on each keystroke, rebuild or passive load. Reduced no shake, opacity150. Error text remains until real resolution.",
    "photo-progress": "actual bytesTransferred/totalBytes only when total>0; ring arc=2pi*p, clamp0..1. Updates reflect actual snapshot values, not elapsed time. Unknown total => indeterminate ring, no percentage. Processing rotation1200ms only while actual processing, no completion claim. Success confirmed => standard scale.98→1 plus photoUploaded. Reduced static processing label, determinate ring jumps to actual p; no loop.",
    "native-date-picker": "platform wheel/calendar owns motion and accessibility; do not replace or simulate native gesture; read-only field, no text keyboard. Existing age rules unchanged.",
    "own-profile-edit": "pencil input opens form through150ms opacity only; lock markers fade150 when visibility changes/own view appears. No Hero or hidden-field animation on someone else profile.",
    "keyboard-follow": "composer + counter + Send + Done follow current OS viewInsets, no second spring/tween; background tap/scroll dismiss. Never animate a keyboard that OS is not showing. Large text can grow composer vertically, controls48dp.",
    "safety-minimal": "opacity150 only, no ring, confetti, hero or celebration. Report received only on server confirmation. A single light success feedback permitted on confirmed submit, mediumImpact on new failure; no repetitive feedback.",
    "deletion-minimal": "no scale/spatial flourish, opacity150 at confirmed received/completed/failure states; do not equate request received with deleted. No celebration or manipulation, no haptic.",
    "settings-contact-minimal": "standard route or reduced150 fade; no loop. Address copied indicator only after clipboard operation succeeds; no mailto. Contact retained values and observed information rules unchanged.",
    "empty-breathe": "one existing decorative glyph opacity .55..70 over4000ms cosine; do not add a person dot or activity indication. Disabled when error/offline/loading, hidden tab or background. Reduced static .65. Never indicate hidden people.",
    "error-strip": "only existing error/status container: offsetY -4→0 and opacity0→1 over150ms. Resolution fades150ms; never dismiss by timer or cover Retry. Reduced opacity only. Existing startup error screens retain their single action, no extra UI required.",
    "tab-indicator": "selected underline slides standard spring between actual tab label centers; logical selected state and accessibility update immediately. One selectionClick at input, none on initial route. Reduced old/new underline crossfade150.",
    "ended-card-removal": "Only after confirmed end: remove the ended connection from the current chat/connection list. Fade the row150ms and collapse its visual slot150ms ease-out; remove semantics and hit targets immediately on confirmation. Reduced: opacity150 only, reflow without spatial animation. If last row ends, show existing messages-connections-empty. Failure/unknown never removes a row. UI removal does not mean message history was deleted; no automatic reconnection. Read-only alone is not ended.",
    "profile-save-return": "Only after confirmed save in existing profile-edit context: pop form to updated own profile, opacity0→1 linearly over150ms. No extra spring, scale, Hero or haptic. Reduced Motion same opacity150. Keep draft and route on failed/pending save. Native back/swipe gestures keep OS-owned motion."
  },
